        "TileImage": "$($repository bf60280b-9b3b-4837-a90e-8cbcfe46d515).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47.\r\rOur client has raised concerns over widespread corruption taking place behind the scenes of the Global Innovation Racing championship series, including race fixing, money laundering, and corporate espionage.\r\rYou are cleared to eliminate the authorized targets by any means. However, any suspicious activity is sure to cause panic in such a public environment and the client has a vested interest in ensuring the GIR does not suffer any adverse publicity.\r\rBest of luck, 47.",
